Provenance note: the occupancy values in data/occupancy/ were derived from
Google Maps popular-times data, which Google aggregates and anonymises at source
using differential privacy techniques. The grant above extends only to the
rights the authors hold in the compiled dataset; Google's own terms govern the
underlying service. The laboratory surveillance series in data/public_cases/
originate from SIVEP-SRAG (Open DataSUS) and InfoDengue, both public and subject
to their own open data terms.
